    whatToExpect: `Tim works from your drawings (or works with your designer to spec them out), pulls the ESA commercial permit, and coordinates with the property manager on power shutdowns and after-hours work if needed. Rough-in is staged around your trade schedule — drywall, mechanical, finishes. We handle the panel work, all new branch circuits, lighting (including emergency egress and exit signs where required), and any three-phase equipment hookups (rooftop units, kitchen equipment, compressors). Final ESA inspection before occupancy.`,
    issuesHeading: 'Common commercial projects.',
